# Flux needs only declared cluster state, admission policy, and Helm charts.
# Default-denying the artifact keeps application source, media, CI evidence,
# documentation, bootstrap material, and provider state off the Pi.
/*
!/.sourceignore
!/kubernetes/
!/policies/
!/websites/

/policies/*
!/policies/kyverno/

/websites/*
!/websites/naranjo.online/
!/websites/lidersea.com/
/websites/naranjo.online/*
!/websites/naranjo.online/chart/
/websites/lidersea.com/*
!/websites/lidersea.com/chart/
